sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Traefik
  participant Gateway
  participant Auth as auth-service
  participant Property as property-service

  Browser->>Traefik: POST /api/auth/login
  Traefik->>Gateway: /api/auth/login
  Gateway->>Auth: public, JWT yok
  Auth-->>Browser: accessToken RS256

  Browser->>Traefik: GET /api/properties/mine + Bearer
  Traefik->>Gateway: JWT doğrula
  Gateway->>Property: X-Authenticated-User-Id / Role
  Property-->>Browser: sahibin ilanları
